     aaiirrppoorrtt — list of IATA airport codes

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The aaiirrppoorrtt file is a list of airports that have an IATA airport code.
     The list is sorted alphabetically by airport code.

     The list is not a complete list of all IATA codes.  New airports can only
     be added by OpenBSD developers who have visited an airport and thereby
     have verified its existence.

